# containers/gvisor-tap-vsock v0.9.0: give the gVisor stack a QueryPerformanceCounter
# monotonic clock on Windows. Go's Windows monotonic clock ticks at 15.625 ms, so RTT
# samples read 0 and RACK floods the guest with spurious retransmissions.
# Applied by build/Dockerfile.rootfs (gvproxy-builder stage). Drop once an upstream release ships an equivalent fix.

